---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import Header from '../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'; import Recommend from '../components/Recommend.astro';
import AdsterraBanner from '../components/ads/AdsterraBanner.astro';
---
<Layout title="퇴직금 계산기 | 예상 퇴직금 계산 | ManyTool" description="최근 3개월 평균임금과 근속기간으로 예상 퇴직금을 간단히 계산해보세요. 참고용 계산기입니다." keywords="퇴직금 계산기, 퇴직금 계산, 예상 퇴직금, 퇴직금 세전"><Header /><main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-8"><section class="rounded-[28px] bg-slate-950 p-6 text-white sm:p-8"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-300">Money Calculator</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black sm:text-4xl">퇴직금 계산기</h1><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">평균임금과 근속연수를 입력해 예상 퇴직금을 계산합니다.</p></section><AdsterraBanner placement="top" /><section class="mt-6 rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><label class="block text-sm font-bold">최근 3개월 총 급여(원)<input id="pay" type="number" placeholder="9000000" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border p-3"/></label><label class="mt-4 block text-sm font-bold">최근 3개월 총 일수<input id="days" type="number" value="92" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border p-3"/></label><label class="mt-4 block text-sm font-bold">근속연수<input id="years" type="number" step="0.01" placeholder="3.5" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border p-3"/></label><button id="run" class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500 px-5 py-3 font-bold">계산하기</button><div id="result" class="mt-6"></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500">참고용 예상치입니다. 실제 금액은 상여금, 수당, 평균임금 산정 기준에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p></section><AdsterraBanner placement="bottom" /><Recommend /></main><Footer /></Layout>
<script is:inline>const p=document.getElementById('pay'),d=document.getElementById('days'),y=document.getElementById('years'),o=document.getElementById('result');document.getElementById('run').onclick=()=>{const avg=Number(p.value)/Number(d.value);const amount=avg*30*Number(y.value);o.innerHTML=amount>0?`예상 퇴직금: <strong class="text-2xl text-cyan-700">${Math.round(amount).toLocaleString()}원</strong>`:'모든 값을 입력해주세요.'};</script>
